# Deterministic multi-room replay fixture v1 — resident scene swap mid-replay.
# The runner consumes the E5 WORLD event on frame 5: world_state and resident
# scene become 0x2B (st02a host) while pads keep driving +x. Synthetic; the
# PCSX2 recorder uses the same grammar for real room transitions.
VERSION 1
ISO_SHA1 -
SAVE_STATE -
WORLD_STATE_INIT 0x0F
FRAME_REF 0
# pad nibble: bit0=+x bit1=-x bit2=+z bit3=-z; magnitude 15 (walk tier)
F0 P00000000
F1 P00000000
F2 P00000000
F3 P00000001
F4 P00000001
# mid-replay room swap 0x0F -> 0x2B (st02a). Event order in file is free.
E5 WORLD 0x2B 0x2B
F5 P00000001
F6 P00000001
F7 P00000001
F8 P00000000
F9 P00000000
F10 P00000000
F11 P00000000